# install-specific notes, prompts and check scripts never go to git (12 Nov 2026, secrets audit): they live in the install's own data folder,
# <data>/notes/ and <data>/box-checks/. See CONTRIBUTING.md. A stray one is refused by scripts/repo-privacy.test.mjs too.
docs/installs/
docs/**/prompts/
*.local.md
scripts/box-checks/
UsersKomputer*
